BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dev Uthani Ekadashi / देव उठनी एकादशी
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTSTAMP:20261103T045158Z
UID:dev_uthani-2026-11-20@dharmasetu
CATEGORIES:festivals\,ekadashi
DESCRIPTION:Why: close the monsoon retreat of the gods and reopen the seaso
 n of household beginnings.\n\nStory: Dev Uthani (Prabodhini) Ekadashi in K
 artika Shukla ends Chaturmas — Vishnu is said to awaken\; marriages and 
 auspicious starts resume.\nSource: Padma Purana / Vaishnava ekadashi lore\
 nWhy: close the monsoon retreat of the gods and reopen the season of house
 hold beginnings.\nModern angle: Calendar bookkeeping for social life after
  monsoon\; cultural. Ekadashi fasting has broader metabolic research links
 .\nEvidence: Plausible\nLink: https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC108
 94978/\nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/review/reasoning.
 html#ekadashi-fasting\nLocation basis: New Delhi. City-specific timing com
 ing later.
LOCATION:New Delhi\, India (reference)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/review/calendar.html#252e1ec
 d88f84577
END:VEVENT
